      "writtenOn": "2025-01-24T15:37:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`false` maintains the same behavior as we have currently, from what I understand. At the moment, Gerrit, doesn\u0027t prevent uploaders from approving their own PRs by default, admins need to define a different submit requirement to achieve this.\nThey would need to do the same now.\n\nI don\u0027t have a strong opinion, if you still think we should change this to `true` I\u0027m happy to do it, but it might be best as a follow up change where we only amend the default behavior.",
      "parentUuid": "a9c6cb8d_a4421c92",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 45,
        "endLine": 213,
        "endChar": 50
