      "writtenOn": "2025-01-28T06:14:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I will second Sasa here. AFAIU `setAllowOverrideInChildProjects \u003d false` means that nobody will be able to override it in their project unless modified here by the Gerrit admin.\nAFAIR (so take it with a pinch of salt 😊), previously, when `MAX_WITH_BLOCK` label function was used anybody could copy the label definition to their project and define what they wanted without changing it on the `All-Projects` level. IOW it was giving the useful default without blocking the possibility to change it as needed in downstream projects. Setting to `false` blocks this possibility.",
      "parentUuid": "14a44ccb_ed51e5d1",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 213,
        "startChar": 45,
        "endLine": 213,
